  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **I Don't Want to Leave You**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [3]\n- **Falling Out**: back after 133 archived shows (3141 days) [3]\n- **Monique the Freak**: back after 43 archived shows (503 days) [3]\n- **LMLYP**: back after 112 archived shows (2302 days) [3]\n- **encore cheers**: rare: 10 archived performances [3]\n- **It's Gonna Be a Long Night**: back after 52 archived shows (1128 days) [3]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **ween2023-03-18.ck63.flacf** (recommended): source not stated; 34 songs; 159 min [1]\n- **ween2023-03-18**: source not stated; 33 songs; 159 min [2]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Microphones were placed on a ten-foot stand in the rear left corner of the floor [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **ween2023-03-18.ck63.flacf**: taped by CPS; source: AKG CK63 > NBob PFA > Sound Devices 744T [1]. Also: Transfer chain: 24-bit/44.1 WAV master, converted to 16-bit/44.1 WAV, then encoded to FLAC [1]\n- **ween2023-03-18**: taped by Rich Cuiffo; transferred by Rich Cuiffo; source: Schoeps MK41s and Schoeps MK22's> Nbob actives > Sound Devices MixPre 6 II [2]\n\n## Art and photos\n\n- Poster by panetory.com: [Ween Tour Brooklyn Bowl Las Vegas Nv Mar 18 2023 Poster 2026](https://panetory.com/ween-tour-brooklyn-bowl-las-vegas-nv-mar-18-2023-poster) [4]\n- Poster by panetory.com: [Ween Tour Brooklyn Bowl Las Vegas Nv Mar 18 2023 Poster 2026](https://panetory.com/ween-tour-brooklyn-bowl-las-vegas-nv-mar-18-2023-poster) [5]",
